      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early settlers Pickworth and Horner families established the first farms and mills that fueled Dale’s growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.daleborough.org/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dale sits along the historic Conemaugh Path, an early Indian trail that guided settlers across the valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.daleborough.org/history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Dale Borough Historical Society was officially formed in September 2019 to research and share the borough’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
