      ],
      "source": "https://www.daleborough.org/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1977 Johnstown Flood claimed ten residents in Dale, a tragedy that still echoes in the community.",
